"You can use wildcard characters, question mark (?) and asterisk (*). A "
"question mark matches any single character, an asterisk matches any "
"sequences of characters."
msgstr ""
"jy kan gebruik willekeurige karakter karakters, vraag merk (?) en asterisk "
"(*). 'n vraag merk ooreenstemmende inskrywings enige enkel karakter, 'n "
"asterisk ooreenstemmende inskrywings enige herhalings van karakters."

